---
source: tests/cli_golden.rs
expression: help
---
Inspect, compare and label recorded runs (`AURA_HOME/runs/`)

Usage: aura runs [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List recorded runs, newest first
  show    Show a run's scorecard and steps
  check   Check whether a run got stuck, and where
  diff    Compare two runs' scorecards and flag regressions
  label   Attach a human label to a run or one of its steps
  verify  Run a check in the run's workspace and record it as the outcome
  branch  Re-run a recorded run from one of its steps
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --mode <MODE>
          Session mode for the desktop window or terminal. Overrides the daemon default (`AURA_DEFAULT_MODE`); the kernel denies any tool call the mode does not allow

          Possible values:
          - agent: Full unrestricted operation subject to user permissions
          - plan:  Read + markdown writes + read-only subprocesses
          - ask:   Read-only
          - debug: Read + sandboxed probes only

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
